          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"runin\">\n               All previously adopted ordinances and amendments thereto shall remain in full force\n               and effect until repealed or amended by the governing body of the city of Fargo.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               Source: 12242 (1966), 2258 (1986).\n               </p></div>",
